   "text": "<div><div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b><!-- 155.1 -->Start Here - Installation Guide</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"Start Here - Installation Guide_pdf\" aria-label=\"&lt;!-- 155.1 --&gt;Start Here - Installation Guide_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd5/cpd56928.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!-- 155.1 --&gt;Start Here - Installation Guide_pdf\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document will assist you with product unpacking, installation and setup.</p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b><!-- 255.1 -->User's Guide</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"User's Guide_html\" aria-label=\"&lt;!-- 255.1 --&gt;User's Guide_html &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd5/cpd56932/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!-- 255.1 --&gt;User\" s=\"\" guide_html'=\"\" data-sku=\"SPT_C11CG31201\" data-element_type=\"txt\">HTML</a>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"User's Guide_pdf\" aria-label=\"&lt;!-- 255.1 --&gt;User's Guide_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd5/cpd56932.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!-- 255.1 --&gt;User\" s=\"\" guide_pdf'=\"\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document contains an overview of the product, specifications, basic and in-depth usage instructions, and information on using options.</p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b><!-- 265.1 -->User's Guide - Epson ScanSmart</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"User's Guide - Epson ScanSmart_html\" aria-label=\"&lt;!-- 265.1 --&gt;User's Guide - Epson ScanSmart_html &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd5/cpd57811/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!-- 265.1 --&gt;User\" s=\"\" guide=\"\" -=\"\" epson=\"\" scansmart_html'=\"\" data-sku=\"SPT_C11CG31201\" data-element_type=\"txt\">HTML</a>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"User's Guide - Epson ScanSmart_pdf\" aria-label=\"&lt;!-- 265.1 --&gt;User's Guide - Epson ScanSmart_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd5/cpd57811.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!-- 265.1 --&gt;User\" s=\"\" guide=\"\" -=\"\" epson=\"\" scansmart_pdf'=\"\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p></p><p>This document contains information about using Epson ScanSmart software.</p><p></p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b>Quick Guide and Warranty</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"Quick Guide and Warranty_pdf\" aria-label=\"Quick Guide and Warranty_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd5/cpd56931.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Quick Guide and Warranty_pdf\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document provides quick reference for common uses and describes Epson's limited warranty for this product. (warranty valid in the U.S. and Canada).</p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<div>\n                                       Black - Standard-capacity&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" Black - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"Black - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t2/t212120.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Black - Standard-capacity\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n<div>\n                                       Cyan - Standard-capacity&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" Cyan - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"Cyan - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t2/t212220.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Cyan - Standard-capacity\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n<div>\n                                       Magenta - Standard-capacity&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" Magenta - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"Magenta - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t2/t212320.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Magenta - Standard-capacity\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n<div>\n                                       Yellow - Standard-capacity&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" Yellow - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"Yellow - Standard-capacityPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t2/t212420.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Yellow - Standard-capacity\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n<div>\n                                       Black - High-capacity&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" Black - High-capacityPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"Black - High-capacityPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t2/t212xl120.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Black - High-capacity\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n<div>\n                                       Cyan - High-capacity&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" Cyan - High-capacityPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"Cyan - High-capacityPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds